{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026U6biLBUDq51794813122.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>TVB 年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》舉行在即，一眾藝員連日來密鑼緊鼓進行外景拍攝及大型舞蹈排練，務求在台慶夜呈現最震撼演出。日前游嘉欣現身6號幹線（中九龍繞道—九龍灣段）參與台慶 Opening 外景拍攝期間，更趁著拍攝空檔自拍一段熱舞短片並上載至社交平台大派福利，火速吸引大批網民關注兼派 Like！</p><p><p><img alt=\"d9d6d389-c096-44ed-8acf-8396a55e9456.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026YJRmahNljv1794813123.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"7ea98d36-ba48-4257-8b24-391ed92e15d5.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026XV6et6ynxW1794813123.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>游嘉欣在帖文中以「Tunnel vibes」為題，短片前半段大晒修長美腿與甜美舞姿，去到末段她更驚喜來個華麗轉身，完美展示連身裙的性感大露背設計，白滑玉背一覽無遺，配上她標誌性的甜美回眸笑容，殺傷力十足，難怪短片一出即令一眾網民睇到心心眼，紛紛留言大讚：「嘉欣愈嚟愈靚女」、「呢個隧道舞步太有氣質」、「轉身嗰下真係電暈人」。</p><p><p><img alt=\"bbd9b64e-d15b-426d-88f8-1adef58cc974.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026uf3BP4T6yH1794813122.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:14:45.413593+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T07:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T19:35:52.454972+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T08:08:09.423124+00:00","content_hash":"57d75d5d1a47b3f1ffaee6fca3cdfd47ed076877cf2fb313cc21ecc325a74f7c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:14:45.413593+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}